{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/983416-solars-vs-lunch","id":983416,"title":"Solars vs Lunch","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-07T11:19:56-07:00","id":983416,"title":"Solars vs Lunch","content":"<b>GM: </b>Its late mid-day when you return home and your belly rumbles in hunger. The ice box is well-stocked. Milk, a roasted chicken, half of a medium pepperoni pizza, provolone cheese, some veggies down below, and some pickles. Anything you might need for lunch.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse PC:</b> What kind of pickles?<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> The little, sweet kind.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> Going for some pickle action.<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> As you try to unscrew the glass jar, you find the lid is on tight. The pickle jar is not yet giving up it delicious lunch content.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse</b>: I thought this was my pickle jar. It\u2019s my ice box, right?<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> It is. It\u2019s your ice box. Though one of your compatriots might have bought the pickles.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> My Lore is high enough that I could introduce the fact\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> Oh no, that\u2019s not necessary. It is your jar of pickles. The lid is simply stuck fast.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> Okay, hmmm. Let me roll Perception + Interrogation for the Character Profile action. Try and see what\u2019s up with this pickle jar.<br /> <br /> <b>GM</b>: \u2026what?<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> Sorry -- Spotless Aura of Virtue sits down in the kitchen with the pickle jar, engaging it in small talk. She wants to know if something\u2019s happened recently. Something that may have caused the pickle jar to stop opening.<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> Stunt bonus.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> Got\u2026 five successes.<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> The pickle jar is not much of a conversationalist. It\u2019s closed off and cool, but still oddly transparent. The pickle jar doesn\u2019t outright say as much, but over time you get an idea of what happened. Previously, you had no difficulty with it, but one of your flatmates had a pickle and screwed the jar on too tightly afterwards.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse: </b>Spotless Aura of Virtue listens intently. Then she reminds the pickle jar of all the good times they\u2019ve had. The many late evenings where Spotless wandered to the ice box and pulled out a pickle. She\u2019s always considered the jar a friend of sorts and would hate it if the rash actions of a teammate were to come between them.<br /> <br /> I\u2019m going to roll Manipulate + Presence\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> Two die bonus<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> \u2026and instill a minor intimacy of \u2018I trust Spotless Virtue and Want to Open Myself for Her.\u2019 I\u2019ll spend three motes on my Excellency. That\u2019s eight successes.<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> The pickle jar still isn\u2019t opening.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> Why not?<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> It\u2019s a pickle jar.<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> I want to point out here. (And, of course, you can continue with the pickle jar if you want.) There are other foods in the fridge. The pizza would be easy enough. You could make yourself a ham and cheese sandwich, no problem.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> I got eight successes on my instill. It\u2019s not even going to open a little?<br /> <br /> <b>GM: </b>That\u2019s just not how it works.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> This is kind of railroady.<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> No!<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> It just feels that way. Like nothing I can do will open this pickle jar.<br /> <br /> <b>GM: </b>You just need to come at it from a different angle.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> That\u2019s fair. Hey, someone help me with this? Spotless Aura could use some help here. She can\u2019t open this pickle jar.<br /> <br /> <b>Night Caste PC: </b>Where are we?<br /> <br /> <b>GM: </b>She\u2019s in the kitchen.<br /> <br /> <b>Night: </b>What\u2019s in the kitchen?<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> Stove, ice box, drawers, towels, pots, pans, utensils\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>Night: </b>Anything to hide behind?<br /> <br /> <b>GM: </b>Sure. There\u2019s one of those half-walls that let you see from the kitchen into the living room. You could duck behind that.<br /> <br /> <b>Night: </b>While the pickle jar is occupied with Spotless, I\u2019m going to duck behind the wall. Crouch low as a ready myself. Can I have a stunt bonus?<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> One die.<br /> <br /> <b>Night: </b>That\u2019s only three successes. Is that enough?<br /> <br /> <b>GM: </b>The pickle jar doesn\u2019t see you. It has no Awareness.<br /> <br /> <b>Night:</b> I\u2019m going to use Sneaky Doggie Sass to build Initiative.<br /> <br /> <b>GM: </b>Okay.<br /> <br /> <b>Dawn Caste PC: </b>Wait? What\u2019s happening? I roll Join Battle.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse:</b> I\u2019m trying to make some lunch but the damn pickle jar won\u2019t open. I tried talking to it but it\u2019s not listening.<br /> <br /> <b>Dawn: </b>Muscle Building Jazzercise for my first action.<br /> <br /> <b>GM: </b>The pickle jar seems unimpressed.<br /> <br /> <b>Dawn: </b>Awesome Beefcake of Fighting roars in fury as he bears down upon the ice box. Lifting it with a deep grunt, he tosses it into the air. He then jumps after it. \u201cYou picked the wrong group to fuck with!\u201d he yells and he spikes it into the linoleum with all his strength. Gonna burn a willpower and spend four motes on my Brawl Excellency. Using Lightning Buttkick Prana and Chimpanzee Jump.<br /> <br /> <b>GM: </b>Beautiful. Two die stunt.<br /> <br /> <b>Dawn: </b>That\u2019s eight withering damage.<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> The ice box slams against the ground hard enough to shake it. It bursts open and food flies out everywhere. The walls are covered in milk and pasta sauce.<br /> <br /> <b>Dawn:</b> Yeah!<br /> <br /> <b>Night: </b>Okay. Leaping from the shadow, I toss my throwing stars, filling the air with a whirling, moonsilver tipped death. As the food flies through the air, it\u2019s caught by a star and pinned to the wall.<br /> <br /> <b>GM: </b>One die.<br /> <br /> <b>Night:</b> Sudden Frag Method, Throw a Ton of Shit Attitude, and from Black Darkness style Totally Overkill Stealth Move. It\u2019s an Ambush so -2 to the food\u2019s defense and it can\u2019t parr\u2026 wait, do I have to roll each attack separately?<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> The food is a battle group.<br /> <br /> <b>Night: </b> Gonna use three motes for Excellency and I have the specialization Alpha Strike for Thrown. And that is\u2026 81 decisive damage.<br /> <br /> <b>GM:</b> The kitchen looks like you turned the washing machine into a blender, shoved your food into it, stuffed it with dynamite, and set it off. It\u2019s absolute carnage. The food stood no chance against your combined forces.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse: </b>Can I have a pickle now?<br /> <br /> <b>GM: </b>Technically, you were holding the pickle jar. It wasn\u2019t in the ice box and it didn\u2019t go flying through the air\u2026 but I\u2019ll say that one of Ganker\u2019s throwing stars hit it and cut off the top. Pickles are all yours.<br /> <br /> <b>Eclipse: </b>I share my pickles with my friends. We have a victory lunch!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":296,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","user":"hippokrene","date":". 10-07-2016, 02:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":39}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T11:33:49-07:00","id":983426,"title":"","content":"<b>Zenith:</b> Haven't you guys heard of take out?<br /> <br /> <b>Twilight:</b> Shit. I have to fix the icebox again?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T11:34:42-07:00","id":983428,"title":"","content":"This had me laughing so hard I cried at work. Thank you for that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T17:35:14-07:00","id":983633,"title":"","content":"I like the absurd Charm names.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span